WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.060
Step 1. Open the Files tab.

1.2
00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:06.283
You can change the name of a file of a patient or an encounter.

1.3
00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:11.072
Open the one that the file belongs to, and select the Files tab.

2.1
00:00:11.072 --> 00:00:13.670
Step 2. Open the More Actions menu.

2.2
00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:18.098
Select the button with three vertical dots in the row of the file.

2.3
00:00:18.098 --> 00:00:22.891
If you can change files here, the menu shows Rename and Archive.

3.1
00:00:22.891 --> 00:00:27.219
Step 3. Select Rename. Care opens the Rename File dialog.

3.2
00:00:27.219 --> 00:00:32.441
The box shows the current name of the file, without its extension.

4.1
00:00:32.441 --> 00:00:34.497
Step 4. Enter the new name.

4.2
00:00:34.497 --> 00:00:38.312
Change the name in the box, but do not add the extension.

4.3
00:00:38.312 --> 00:00:43.161
Care keeps the extension and shows it after the name in the list.

5.1
00:00:43.161 --> 00:00:46.578
Step 5. Save the new name. Select Proceed.

5.2
00:00:46.578 --> 00:00:51.603
To close the dialog without a change, select Cancel instead.
